Current simple-card is parsing DAI link for both
"normal sound" and "DPCM sound".
Becuse it needs to parse each links, the code is very mysterious.
Mystery code will be trouble in the future.
This patch cleanup the code by using asoc_simple_card_for_each_link()
which judges normal link / DPCM link.

Signed-off-by: Kuninori Morimoto <kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
